WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.681
F2.3 · Segregation of duties and two-factor authentication

2
00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:11.023
The person who prepares a payment run can neither approve nor sign it.

3
00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:14.932
The run needs two different signers, each within a signing limit.

4
00:00:16.831 --> 00:00:20.647
In K-φ, prepare, approve and sign are separate rights.

5
00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:23.171
A signer without a limit cannot sign.

6
00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:29.738
Every user can turn on two-factor; admins and approvers should.

7
00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:32.862
It protects sign-in and never blocks saving work.

8
00:00:34.012 --> 00:00:36.167
Three checks auditors look at first.

9
00:00:43.312 --> 00:00:47.059
Next: F3.1  Importing a general ledger

